ity to the dominant color. For testing, I could set the dominant color 1 to map to 0 and the minority color 5 to 1. Now, I just need to implement this correctly!","t":1792637019.2532756,"summary":true},{"type":"tool","name":"write_file","input":"{\n \"path\": \"/home/USER/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/stage1/HPL0-hermes-luna6-low-ws0/frozen/seen/play/users/u022/system/state/workspace/programs/task-60151853.py\",\n \"content\": \"def transform(grid):\\n    from collections import Counter\\n    counts = Counter(v for row in grid for v in row)\\n    background = counts.most_common(1)[0][0]\\n    other = next(v for v in counts if v != background)\\n    return [[0 if v == background else background for v in row] for row in grid]\\n\",\n \"cross_profile\": false\n}","t":1792637019.2532756,"stored":["/home/USER/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/stage1/HPL0-hermes-luna6-low-ws0/frozen/seen/play/users/u022/system/state/workspace/programs/task-60151853.py"],"output":"{\"bytes_written\": 291, \"dirs_created\": true, \"verified\": true, \"lint\": {\"status\": \"ok\", \"output\": \"\"}, \"resolved_path\": \"/home/USER/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/stage1/HPL0-hermes-luna6-low-ws0/frozen/seen/play/users/u022/system/state/workspace/programs/task-60151853.py\", \"files_modified\": [\"/home/USER/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/stage1/HPL0-hermes-luna6-low-ws0/frozen/seen/play/users/u022/system/state/workspace/programs/task-60151853.py\"]}"},{"type":"tool","name":"terminal","input":"{\n \"command\": \"python3 -c 'import importlib.util; s=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\\\"t\\\",\\\"programs/task-60151853.py\\\"); m=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s); s.loader.exec_module(m); g=[[7,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,5,7,7],[7,7,5,5,5,7,7,7,5,7,7,7,7],[7,5,7,7,5,7,7,5,5,7,7,7,7],[7,7,5,7,7,7,7,7,7,5,7,7,5],[7,5,7,5,7,5,5,7,5,7,7,5,5],[7,7,5,5,7,7,5,5,7,7,7,7,7],[5,7,5,7,7,7,5,7,5,5,5,7,7],[5,7,7,5,5,5,5,7,7,5,7,7,7],[7,5,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,7,5],[7,7,5,7,7,5,7,5,5,5,5,7,7],[7,5,7,7,